{"parse": {"title": "TTL-01", "pageid": 28150, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTL-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTL-02\" title=\"TTL-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTL</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.91.A8.E6.9C.9F.E6.80.A7.E6.8C.A3.E6.89.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"周期性挣扎\">周期性挣扎</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 周期性挣扎</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Periodical Suffering</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1770301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>“我似乎伫立了很久”</i><br /><br /><i>“思绪万千，却一言未发”</i><br /><br /><i>“南岛上的三位水手仍然活着”</i><br /><br /><i>“那些本应早已逝去的人们”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>弗兰南群岛上发生了太多太多的事，其中的每一幕都令我印象深刻，难以割舍……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>尽管《弗兰南群岛史》已经连载了好几期，但我所记录的甚至不到十分之一……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>读者们一定都像我一样，迫不及待地等着下一期的《白日梦邮报》……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>呼……我不能辜负他们的期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的姑娘揉了揉眼睛，将思绪重新浸入脖颈与帽檐之间的领地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>留给《群岛史》的版面大概还有三分之一张报纸……可这座岛上还有太多我没有提及的内容，它们说不定正是读者尚未了解的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>丹尼希女士曾说，连编辑们都对弗兰南群岛的谜团相当好奇……如果内容足够丰富，兴许她会允许我再补充一节！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这样，人们就能完整地了解弗兰南群岛发生的一切了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打起精神，又伏在了书案上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“弗兰南群岛，位于苏格兰的外赫布里底群岛之中。关于它的讨论已持续了数年。直到今天，我们仍能记起关于它的传闻……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“据可靠消息称，不论是在灯塔内，抑或是岛上的任何一处角落，一切似乎都无比正常。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“除了那三位离奇消失的灯塔管理员……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“人们纷纷猜测其中的可能性。来自官方的调查员先生坚持认为，某场意外发生的海上风暴吞没了他们……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“但这显然无法说服大多数人……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306522.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306522.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306522.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306522.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306522.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306522.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306522.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306522.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“有水手声称，他在弗兰南群岛的上空目睹了来自太空的飞碟，它们通体黝黑，散发着幽深而寒冷的光束……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“当然，关于巨型鸟类、无底深渊的猜测同样不少……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“人们众说纷纭，但始终没能得出答案……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“警察先生们出具的调查报告，守塔员们所遗留的日志记录，以及迟迟未能找到的尸体……它们提醒着我，这绝非一起简单的失踪事件……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“尽管已过去了十二年，但怀着对真相的好奇，我仍然决定来到这座岛上……也见到了那份始终没有公开的记录。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“上面的落款是，1900年12月15日 记录人：杜卡特。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>握笔的手顿在了半空，如同无风的帆船，迟迟未能驶入下一行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这起事件已经过去了这么多年，关于岛上的谜团并没有减少，反而越来越多了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……该如何拣选这些素材呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>当我尚未踏上这座岛时，我便听说了水手们的传闻。途径这儿的船只大多会无故抛锚，甲板上甚至会渗出古怪的液体……以致于这儿的航线远比其他岛更少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>这是个值得一写的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>可……十二年都不曾中断的灯塔同样是个重大的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>如果没能将它记入《弗兰南群岛史》，我一定会抱憾终身……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>当然，还有最重要的守塔员失踪事件……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她陷入了迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>残酷的、不留情面的选择题横亘在这个可怜姑娘的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>《弗兰南群岛史》属于弗兰南群岛全体对象。出于公平起见，我也应该平等地使用它们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>无论放弃哪一个，都是对弗兰南群岛的背弃，是对这本书的误读！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光游离，落在更多、更多的稿纸之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一条足以容纳所有内容的路显现了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我放下了那本记录本，注意到身前这个仍然发着光亮的灯塔。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“在那段离奇的失踪案之后，再也没有新的管理员愿意驻扎在弗兰南群岛……艾琳·莫尔灯塔早已无人维护，至少本应如此。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chuancangneibu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chuancangneibu\"><img alt=\"chuancangneibu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/600px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/900px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/1200px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我站在灯塔的底下，逐级向上攀爬。出乎我意料的是，脚下的石阶，严丝合缝的绳结与螺丝，以及从塔顶向四周洒下暖黄色光亮的灯泡……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“它们无声无息，却又诚实地向我传达着一个震撼了我许久的讯息：使那座灯塔得以正常运转的一切，都仍保存着十二年前的余光！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我的脚步虚浮，几乎惊讶地向后仰翻……可我要怎么相信呢？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“那些使我双脚打滑的苔藓与斑驳的划痕，毫不留情地向我证明着，这儿确确实实已经历经了整整十二年的时光。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“在短暂地平复心情后，我决定开始探索这儿。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“在此之前，我鸣响了船上的汽笛，以便途径这儿的船只能够注意到这儿。随后，我拿起了仅剩三支的信号弹……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“倘若我真的不幸遭遇了意外，凭借这个，海上警事至少能在一周之内来到这儿，收殓我的遗体，也能够将这本群岛史出版，以向世界证明我的贡献。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“再次踏上岛屿后，我的心情早已没有最初的惬意与闲适，些许恐惧与愁苦掩住了它们。但值得庆幸的是，我的心中仍然怀着为人类进步而努力的勇气……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“以及揭开那片令人陌生的、神秘世界的真相。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“紧锁的房间无法阻挡我的脚步，我灵活地翻过了橱窗，爬进了这个理应早已无人问津的逼仄空间里。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯沉浸在自己唯一的世界里，在白纸上肆意漫步，在墨色的文字间徜徉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“厨房的门敞开着，里面空无一物，既无发霉的苹果或柑橘，也缺乏必要的蜘蛛网布景。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我的大脑不由自主地放松了下来，一个更加显而易见，也更加令人轻松的想法从我的脑海中升起。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“这也许是一场失败的恶作剧，并且稍显拙劣。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306519.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306519.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-306519.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306519.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“兴许只是某个心血来潮的善良海员路过了这里，为了全体航船的安全，也为了自身的荣誉，他自发地更换了灯塔的灯源，处理了锈迹斑斑的老旧螺丝……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我如此想着。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马库斯奋笔疾书，周遭的一切声响似乎都远远地消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“出于必要的环节考虑，我决定在离开之前做最后一次无关紧要的确认。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306523.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306523.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-306523.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306523.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“这是一场新悲剧的开始。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_guanzhedemen1\"><img alt=\"at_guanzhedemen1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png/600px-Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png/900px-Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png/1200px-Cg-at_guanzhedemen1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“我鬼使神差地敲响了卧室的门……当然，我很快便意识到了自己的愚蠢。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚咚——！”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“而当我正准备用力推开那扇尘封的门时，它毫无征兆地打开了，挟着刺耳的嘎吱声。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“突如其来的脱力使我踉跄地跌了进去，摔到了壁炉旁。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“不慎擦在手中的煤灰并没有如预想般的冷硬，它们有着恰到好处的余温，似乎理所当然温暖着房内的所有人。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“两道由透明而逐渐变得清晰的身影映入我的眼帘，同时被映出的还有我强烈的恐惧。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“你们是……幽灵？！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“而这两位幽灵先生的惶恐并不亚于我，‘你能看见我们——？！’他们发出了尖锐的呐喊。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“当我们面面相觑时，一阵不紧不慢的敲门声响了起来，来自门外——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>“咚咚——！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚咚咚——！咚咚——！”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dengta_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dengta_ye\"><img alt=\"dengta_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/600px-Cg-dengta_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/900px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-dengta_ye.png/1200px-Cg-dengta_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突兀响起的敲门声似乎并不只是作者颅内的情绪渲染。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>马库斯女士……马库斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你在里面吗——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>啊……是的，我在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急急忙忙地收拢那些在桌面上躺得四仰八合的稿纸，将它们整齐地码在一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在外面的声音变得更加不耐烦之前，门终于小心翼翼地被拉开一条缝。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>你好，马库斯女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前这抹冷硬的灰白色与错落的格子礼貌地朝她点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-306517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……您好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">调查员：</div><div>如你所见，我是圣洛夫基金会的调查员，负责埃利安锡尔区域的神秘学家登记与注册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的语气淡漠，毫不遮掩地显露着他的骄傲，理所当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/HeadIconSmall-306521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>基、基金会……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遗憾的是，对方似乎并不能理解这个名字所代表的重要意义。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTL-01"}}